5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I pulled the fortnight's tally of use by person. The data shows the two nearest the door used it eleven times, while the rest of us combined only four.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,That imbalance suggests the current setup favors proximity over actual need. We should look at the partition wall to see if sound is driving that usage.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, that tally is useful, but I’m more worried about the hidden costs. I’ll check the invoices for outside hire to see what we’re actually paying.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’ll check the quotes for the two fit-outs. We need hard numbers before we agree to anything, not just guesses.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I’ll look into the partition wall and the crumbs at the desks. Sound and mess are the real complaints, not principle.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, the invoices show what we paid, not what we save. I need to know if the current arrangement is actually costing us time.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, time is a factor, but so is connection. I’ll check where the last awkward conversation happened to see if isolation is the real issue.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, hard numbers are good, but I need to know where the hours go. I’ll check the round trip for a hot lunch.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, connection is nice, but it doesn’t pay the bills. I’m sticking with the quotes; I need to see the actual cost before we commit to anything.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, you are right to question the time cost. I will look into the facilities callouts to see if maintenance is eating into our hours.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, maintenance logs are useful, but I need to know who actually cleans up. I’ll check the final clear-out of the old fridge to see the pattern.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, the fridge is a symptom, not the cause. I’ll check the unplanned talk since the refit to see if we’ve lost our natural meeting points.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I’m not done with the lunch run. I need to know if we’re wasting twenty-five minutes daily just to eat.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
