37,2,1,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Jonathan, that’s a heavy burden to carry. I found the lunch run takes twenty-five minutes, three days a week. That’s hours lost.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, twenty-five minutes is a fact, not a feeling. I’m still waiting on those quotes. I need the yen figures before I sign anything.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shunichi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi: @May, twenty-five minutes is a fact, not a feeling. I’m still waiting on those quotes. I need the yen figures before I sign anything.""}]}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, patience. I found the wall is thin plasterboard; sound travels freely. That explains the complaints about noise.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: @Shunichi, patience. I found the wall is thin plasterboard; sound travels freely. That explains the complaints about noise.""}]}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Servas, thin walls explain the noise, but the fridge clear-out showed the real problem. One person did the work twice. Who volunteers next?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, the fridge is a symptom of neglect, not a solution. I found that since the refit, unplanned talk has vanished. We are strangers now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Ryuji, the fridge is a symptom, but the invoices are the wound. We paid 68,000 yen for nine bookings. That is money we could have spent on a proper kitchen.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, 68,000 yen is a leak, not a solution. I have the quotes: 141,000 for a meeting space, 96,000 for a kitchen. Which one stops the bleeding?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the kitchen is cheaper, but the crumbs are already under three keyboards. I found the mess is spreading. We need to stop the source, not just the symptom.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Shunichi, the quotes are clear, but the burden is not. If we choose the kitchen, who cleans the crumbs? I need a rule, not just a price tag.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, rules are easy to write, hard to keep. I found the awkward talk happened in front of everyone. We need privacy, not just a schedule.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Ryuji, rules don't clean crumbs. I found we paid 68,000 yen for outside hire. If we build a kitchen, we stop that leak entirely.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, 96,000 yen is cheaper than 141,000, but it doesn't fix the noise. I need to know who signs for the maintenance before I agree to the kitchen.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the signature is a formality. The real cost is the silence. If we choose the kitchen, the noise stays. If we choose the meeting space, the crumbs stay.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the signature is a formality. The real cost is the silence. If we choose the kitchen, the noise stays. If we choose the meeting space, the crumbs stay.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, you are right that the burden is real. But a quiet room solves the noise, not the mess. We need a space that respects both our need for silence and our need for connection.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, the kitchen quote is 96,000 yen. That’s less than the 141,000 for the meeting space. If we build it, we stop paying the 68,000 yen outside hire.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
