67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, the rule is simple: whoever cooks cleans. I’m not volunteering for the bins, but I’ll stop the 68,000 yen leak.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
