70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Shunichi, I will sign for the maintenance if we adopt the kitchen. The 68,000 yen leak is unacceptable, and I will ensure the bins are emptied.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, your offer is generous, but it ignores the noise. A kitchen in a thin-walled room guarantees complaints. I cannot support it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
